  "final_answer": "I have successfully navigated to the Google Maps Search Settings page and captured all the options shown. Here's the complete list of options on the page:\n\n# Google Maps Search Settings\n\nWhen clicking \"Search Settings\" from Google Maps, it opens the **Google Search Settings (Google 搜索设置)** page, which has two main sections in the side menu:\n\n## 🔒 Privacy and Security (隐私和安全)\n\n**Activity (活动)** section:\n- **Customized Search Results (定制化搜索结果)** — Currently **Enabled** (已开启)\n  - \"When customized search results is enabled, Google provides search results and recommendations tailored to your search history in this browser\"\n\n**Content (内容)** section:\n- **SafeSearch (安全搜索)** — Currently set to **\"Blur\" Enabled** (\"模糊处理\"已开启)\n  - For controlling the types of search results displayed (personalized/explicit content)\n\n**More Options (更多选项)**:\n- **Parental Controls in Family Link (Family Link 中的家长控制功能)**\n\n## ⚙️ Other Settings (其他设置)\n\n**Language (语言)** section:\n- **Language and Region (语言和地区)** — \"Manage the display language of Google Search, and choose search result preferences\"\n\n**Desktop (桌面)** section — \"Customize the appearance and behavior of Google Search on your device\":\n- **Dark Theme (深色主题)** — Set to **Device Default** (设备默认设置)\n- **Open search results in new window (在新窗口中打开搜索结果)** — **ON**\n- **Voice Reply (语音答复)** — **ON**\n- **Autocomplete trending searches (自动补全热搜字词)** — **ON**\n\n## 📎 Footer Links\n- Feedback (反馈)\n- Help (帮助)\n- Privacy (隐私权)\n- Terms (条款)\n\nNote: Google Maps uses Google's general search functionality, so its \"Search Settings\" menu links to the broader Google Search Settings page rather than having Maps-specific options.",
